--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 207ddad3e1c90594ba3f48e2a5a6a796, type: 3}
  m_Name: 9 PostFightDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
  - bodyText: <i>Everyone is exhausted, but the battle is won. Many candidates are
      injured but none dead.
    speakerName: Narration
    displayingImage: {fileID: 0}
    broadcastAnEvent: 0
  - bodyText: <i>The examiners discuss amongst themselves and come to a verdict.
    speakerName: Narration
    displayingImage: {fileID: 0}
    broadcastAnEvent: 0
  - bodyText: 'Attention examinees, this marks the end of quite an unprecedented
      exam.  '
    speakerName: Ives
    displayingImage: {fileID: 0}
    broadcastAnEvent: 1
  - bodyText: "I\u2019d like to congratulate you all for fighting so valiantly to
      neutralize this unknown threat.  "
    speakerName: Ives
    displayingImage: {fileID: 0}
    broadcastAnEvent: 0
  - bodyText: We examiners have seen the exceptional skills that you have all displayed
      during this battle.
    speakerName: Ives
    displayingImage: {fileID: 0}
    broadcastAnEvent: 0
  - bodyText: 'So look forward to the examination results in a couple days. '
    speakerName: Ives
    displayingImage: {fileID: 0}
    broadcastAnEvent: 0
  - bodyText: 'For now, we''ll return to camp and wait for reinforcements to arrive. '
    speakerName: Ives
    displayingImage: {fileID: 0}
    broadcastAnEvent: 0
  - bodyText: I'm gonna need a breather...
    speakerName: Ives
    displayingImage: {fileID: 0}
    broadcastAnEvent: 0
